3. Required visible credit — an essential condition

Every use, execution, public demonstration and distribution of a build
containing Line Materials must retain a clearly legible, readily accessible
credit in the launcher's main interface, outside the About dialog. It must
remain visible during ordinary use, including configuration, authentication,
server selection and installation. It must not be hidden behind a dialog,
removed at particular breakpoints, obscured, or made effectively unreadable.

At least one of these exact phrases must be displayed; displaying both is
permitted and is the default:

    Работает на Line Launcher | Plus In Plus
    Powered by Line Launcher | Plus In Plus

This is the "Required Credit". The names "Line Launcher" and "Plus In Plus"
and the vertical-bar separator must be retained. Translation, replacement
with only a provider's brand, or omission of either name is not permitted.
The main-interface credit may be placed in the footer or header. The About
dialog must repeat the credit; an About-only credit is insufficient.

The build configuration may select the permitted placement and language.
It may not disable, rewrite or conditionally remove the Required Credit.
Removing or bypassing it in source code, generated files, styles or a compiled
build is outside the permission granted by this license. WITHOUT THE REQUIRED
CREDIT, NO PERMISSION TO USE OR DISTRIBUTE LINE MATERIALS IS GRANTED.

